      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would still make for an inconsistancy\n\nIf you're trying to dance together, to the same song...  Either the track will be delayed on your end, or on their end, you can't have both.\n\nEither way, it will be out of sync, and I don't think there is a solution, unless it was just for one person dancing. \nYou could dance on your screen to the music, but if the music was delayed to match your movements, and they tried to dance to that, YOU would see them delayed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
